### Drill 3: Progressive Rollout, History, and Rollback

Execute the interactive walkthrough script:

```bash
cd ../03-rolling-updates-rollbacks
./rollout-drill.sh
```

Or execute the steps manually:

1. Deploy baseline version 1:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f 01-catalog-v1.yaml
   kubectl rollout status deployment/cka-lab-catalog-service
   ```

1. Apply version 2:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f 02-catalog-v2.yaml
   kubectl rollout status deployment/cka-lab-catalog-service
   ```

1. Inspect rollout history and recorded change causes:

   ```bash
   kubectl rollout history deployment/cka-lab-catalog-service
   ```

1. Roll back to revision 1:

   ```bash
   kubectl rollout undo deployment/cka-lab-catalog-service --to-revision=1
   kubectl rollout status deployment/cka-lab-catalog-service
   ```

1. Confirm container image is reverted:

   ```bash
   kubectl get deployment cka-lab-catalog-service -o jsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].image}'
   ```

